APP_ENV=dev, stage or prod, selects the config file next to config/base.yml
APP_CONFIG_OVERLAY=optional path to a YAML file laid over base and contour config, the price scenario builds with it
E2E_BASE_URL=address of the site under test with the base path and a trailing slash, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:4322/landing-voda-danang/
E2E_SITE_DIR=built site to serve at E2E_BASE_URL before the tests, e.g. dist; empty when testing a deployed site
